{"path":"regex/regex_search","title":"std::regex_search","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>regex_search","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/regex_search","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"Determines if there is a match between the regular expression e and some subsequence in the target character sequence. The detailed match result is stored in m (if present).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/regex\">&lt;regex&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> BidirIt, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Alloc, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> regex_search<span class=\"br0\">(</span> BidirIt first, BidirIt last,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results\"><span class=\"kw2024\">std::<span class=\"me2\">match_results</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>BidirIt, Alloc<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> m,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/basic_regex\"><span class=\"kw2016\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_regex</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> e,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_flag_type\"><span class=\"kw2054\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex_constants</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">match_flag_type</span></span></a> flags <sp